      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div class=\"focus-tree-card\">\n<h2 class=\"focus-tree-title\">Explore Novel Food Sources</h2>\n<p class=\"focus-tree-desc\">The infestation of vermin in our food storage presents a risk and an opportunity. We need not let valuable resources go to waste.</p>\n<p class=\"focus-tree-req-head\">Requirements</p>\n<p class=\"focus-tree-req\">No prerequisites.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"focus-tree-btn\" id=\"_focus_btn_ft_explore_novel_food_sources\" disabled onclick=\"siloFocusTreeComplete(this,'ft_explore_novel_food_sources')\">Complete focus</button>\n<div class=\"focus-tree-done\" id=\"_focus_done_ft_explore_novel_food_sources\" style=\"display:none;\">Completed</div>\n</div>"
      }
    },
    {
