      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div class=\"focus-tree-card\">\n<h2 class=\"focus-tree-title\">Fireside Chats</h2>\n<p class=\"focus-tree-desc\">Structured morale broadcasts beyond a single reassuring tone \u2014 rotate framing without letting rumor own the silence between drills.</p>\n<p class=\"focus-tree-req-head\">Requirements</p>\n<p class=\"focus-tree-req\">Complete Explore Novel Food Sources. Give Speech once after the rumor exodus crisis ends.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"focus-tree-btn\" id=\"_focus_btn_ft_fireside_chats\" disabled onclick=\"siloFocusTreeComplete(this,'ft_fireside_chats')\">Complete focus</button>\n<div class=\"focus-tree-done\" id=\"_focus_done_ft_fireside_chats\" style=\"display:none;\">Completed</div>\n</div>"
      }
    },
