      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div class=\"focus-tree-card\">\n<h2 class=\"focus-tree-title\">Venture Out</h2>\n<p class=\"focus-tree-desc\">Acknowledge that some trusted voices will test the threshold themselves \u2014 and prepare the Inner Circle for harder bargains indoors.</p>\n<p class=\"focus-tree-req-head\">Requirements</p>\n<p class=\"focus-tree-req\">Complete Fireside Chats and Found Bunker Shakespeare Company. Unlocks when population drops below two-thirds of the original headcount.</p>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"focus-tree-btn\" id=\"_focus_btn_ft_venture_out\" disabled onclick=\"siloFocusTreeComplete(this,'ft_venture_out')\">Complete focus</button>\n<div class=\"focus-tree-done\" id=\"_focus_done_ft_venture_out\" style=\"display:none;\">Completed</div>\n</div>"
